	(gr_text "Trace width: 0.15mm \nImpedance on standard 4L board with DK=4.74 H=0.1855mm T=0.035m is almost exactly 75 Ohm\nwhich is fine for Pentium signaling (according to the design guides)\n\nFor ~0.32mm we have 50 Ohm impedance which should be ok for the clock"
		(at 281.559 46.863 0)
		(layer "User.3")
		(uuid "842d4995-dafe-4ef9-ac4f-475d8ea76c25")
		(effects
